WEBVTT

01:49.460 --> 01:54.940
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.009 --> 01:57.940
[Episode 19]

01:58.030 --> 02:01.950
[Song Residence]

02:05.200 --> 02:06.840
Are these the betrothal gifts

02:06.840 --> 02:08.080
from Her Ladyship?

02:10.280 --> 02:12.000
Of course not, Madam.

02:12.000 --> 02:13.080
These small gifts

02:13.080 --> 02:15.680
are just to help calm Miss Song's nerves.

02:16.470 --> 02:17.430
Her Ladyship said

02:17.430 --> 02:19.240
Miss Song is well-educated
and well-mannered.

02:19.240 --> 02:21.590
She must have been frightened that day.

02:21.590 --> 02:22.960
She's been thinking about her

02:22.960 --> 02:24.870
and sent me to invite her

02:24.870 --> 02:26.870
to stay at the Fanghua Hall
for a few days.

02:26.870 --> 02:27.630
Madam…

02:27.630 --> 02:28.280
What?

02:28.960 --> 02:29.840
No way!

02:30.590 --> 02:32.450
She has neither an official title

02:32.680 --> 02:34.280
nor an imperial decree.

02:34.280 --> 02:35.960
How can she just go like that?

02:35.960 --> 02:36.560
Absolutely not.

02:36.560 --> 02:37.360
I don't approve.

02:37.360 --> 02:39.360
If Her Ladyship has given the order,

02:40.150 --> 02:41.800
then Yimeng should get ready

02:41.800 --> 02:42.960
and go.

02:43.840 --> 02:44.680
Master.

02:45.079 --> 02:46.430
If she really goes,

02:46.430 --> 02:47.840
doesn't that make her engagement

02:47.840 --> 02:49.400
to His Highness official?

02:49.400 --> 02:50.310
Didn't you oppose it?

02:50.310 --> 02:52.680
Who runs this house,
you or me?

02:52.680 --> 02:53.430
I mean…

02:53.960 --> 02:55.820
Go invite Miss Song to the palace.

02:56.400 --> 02:57.190
Yes.

03:14.000 --> 03:15.430
I-Is

03:15.840 --> 03:16.870
such fanfare

03:17.280 --> 03:18.400
really necessary?

03:19.560 --> 03:20.400
Miss Song,

03:20.560 --> 03:22.030
Her Ladyship said

03:22.079 --> 03:23.240
whatever others get,

03:23.240 --> 03:24.280
you should have too.

03:24.280 --> 03:25.360
And what they don't get,

03:25.360 --> 03:26.820
you should still be given.

03:27.470 --> 03:28.280
Please.

03:34.440 --> 03:38.300
[How to Not Marry a Prince – Day One]

03:38.280 --> 03:39.079
My Lady,

03:38.329 --> 03:39.010
[Fanghua Hall]

03:39.150 --> 03:40.430
Miss Song is here.

03:41.430 --> 03:42.470
I'm Song Yimeng.

03:42.470 --> 03:43.310
Greetings, My Lady.

03:43.310 --> 03:43.960
Yimeng,

03:43.960 --> 03:44.680
come here.

03:46.590 --> 03:47.630
You're

03:47.630 --> 03:48.840
such a sweet girl.

03:48.840 --> 03:50.630
I really like you.

03:51.030 --> 03:52.690
Thank you for the compliment.

03:53.560 --> 03:55.240
In the past, I used to think

03:55.280 --> 03:57.590
if any girl liked Heng,

03:57.630 --> 03:59.280
no matter if she was pretty or ugly,

03:59.280 --> 04:00.280
no matter her temper,

04:00.280 --> 04:01.030
I would

04:01.030 --> 04:02.800
help him marry her.

04:03.240 --> 04:04.750
But I didn't expect

04:04.840 --> 04:06.280
Heng to have such good taste.

04:06.280 --> 04:08.240
He fell for a kind

04:08.240 --> 04:10.560
and lovely girl like you.

04:11.470 --> 04:12.470
One day,

04:12.630 --> 04:14.360
if I can no longer hold on,

04:14.750 --> 04:16.160
I'll leave him in your hands

04:16.160 --> 04:17.800
without worry.

04:19.950 --> 04:20.750
My Lady,

04:22.800 --> 04:25.600
I'm afraid I can't accept that.

04:28.630 --> 04:30.630
I don't have feelings
for the Seventh Prince,

04:30.630 --> 04:32.630
and I never thought of marrying him.

04:33.830 --> 04:35.270
To be honest with you,

04:35.800 --> 04:37.040
I actually came

04:37.040 --> 04:39.370
to the palace this time
to ask for your help

04:39.480 --> 04:41.210
in calling off the engagement.

04:41.480 --> 04:42.480
Calling it off?

04:42.630 --> 04:43.360
Why?

04:43.360 --> 04:45.270
Do you believe those rumors too

04:45.480 --> 04:47.159
and think Heng brings bad luck?

04:47.159 --> 04:47.950
No, no,

04:48.130 --> 04:50.010
that's not it at all.

04:50.270 --> 04:50.830
I-It's

04:50.830 --> 04:51.830
because…

04:52.070 --> 04:52.600
because…

04:55.330 --> 04:56.120
Even if I told you,

04:56.120 --> 04:57.480
you wouldn't believe it.

04:57.480 --> 04:59.430
Anyway, I can't marry him,

04:59.480 --> 05:00.630
and I won't.

05:01.070 --> 05:02.600
Please forgive me, My Lady.

05:03.600 --> 05:06.360
Your marriage to Heng is no small matter.

05:06.630 --> 05:09.070
It must be carefully considered.

05:13.870 --> 05:14.510
[Moonlit Blossoms]

05:14.510 --> 05:18.190
[How to Not Marry a Prince – Day Two]

05:27.050 --> 05:29.050
Why haven't you taken a single bite?

05:29.070 --> 05:30.240
You don't like them?

05:30.680 --> 05:32.470
How could I eat them?

05:33.830 --> 05:36.020
It looks like a feast.

05:36.480 --> 05:37.610
And look over there.

05:37.830 --> 05:40.480
It's like they're dressing me
for fashion week.

05:40.480 --> 05:41.270
Her Ladyship

05:41.270 --> 05:43.480
is dead set on marrying me to Nan Heng.

05:43.630 --> 05:45.830
If I eat, wear, and use these things,

05:45.830 --> 05:48.560
won't I owe her big time?

05:51.630 --> 05:52.430
No way.

05:53.270 --> 05:55.680
I have to find a way to return the favor

05:55.870 --> 05:58.070
and convince Her Ladyship that

05:58.070 --> 06:00.270
I must not marry His Highness.

06:01.070 --> 06:02.950
Her Ladyship is used to

06:02.950 --> 06:04.680
all kinds of luxurious things.

06:05.000 --> 06:06.630
How can you return her favor?

06:15.160 --> 06:16.470
I have an idea.

06:19.830 --> 06:20.680
My Lady,

06:21.070 --> 06:22.870
it's time to take your medicine.

06:31.950 --> 06:34.680
My future daughter-in-law
is about to slip away.

06:34.750 --> 06:37.000
What's the point of the regimen?

06:38.680 --> 06:39.480
My Lady,

06:39.680 --> 06:40.800
I heard that

06:41.040 --> 06:43.800
Miss Song has been sighing
in her room all the time,

06:43.800 --> 06:44.830
looking upset.

06:45.240 --> 06:47.480
If you don't come up with something soon,

06:47.480 --> 06:48.830
this engagement really might

06:48.830 --> 06:50.680
be called off.

06:56.680 --> 06:57.480
Tell me.

06:58.560 --> 07:01.000
If I pick a few concubines for Heng,

07:01.560 --> 07:03.560
do you think Yimeng might change her mind?

07:03.560 --> 07:04.270
My Lady,

07:04.630 --> 07:06.870
are you trying to help

07:07.160 --> 07:08.720
or making things worse?

07:09.240 --> 07:10.270
You don't get it.

07:10.480 --> 07:11.560
As long as

07:11.630 --> 07:13.160
Chu Guihong

07:13.160 --> 07:14.220
keeps chasing her,

07:14.240 --> 07:16.480
she'll never see how great Heng is.

07:19.240 --> 07:20.630
Once there's competition,

07:20.630 --> 07:21.830
she'll see his worth.

07:22.070 --> 07:23.480
Brilliant move, My Lady!

07:26.420 --> 07:29.370
[How to Not Marry a Prince – Day Three]

07:28.680 --> 07:29.480
My Lady.

07:30.190 --> 07:31.040
I made

07:31.070 --> 07:33.830
some tea drinks just for you.

07:34.390 --> 07:35.240
Have a taste.

07:36.690 --> 07:38.820
[Bubble Tea]

07:37.000 --> 07:38.920
What is this?

07:40.040 --> 07:40.830
My Lady,

07:40.830 --> 07:41.390
it's called

07:41.390 --> 07:43.270
bubble tea.

07:43.870 --> 07:45.870
You can get it with half sugar,
full sugar, or no sugar—

07:45.870 --> 07:47.270
iced, with no ice, or at room temperature.

07:47.270 --> 07:49.240
The base teas are black, green, or oolong.

07:49.240 --> 07:50.830
There are flavors like osmanthus,
rose, and crabapple,

07:50.830 --> 07:53.120
and you can add things
like sweet fermented rice balls.

07:53.120 --> 07:55.070
You can try all of them if you'd like.

07:55.070 --> 07:56.430
Bubble tea?

08:02.270 --> 08:03.070
Not bad.

08:05.070 --> 08:05.870
Yimeng,

08:06.160 --> 08:07.430
as it happens,

08:07.430 --> 08:10.240
I actually have something
to discuss with you.

08:11.240 --> 08:12.040
My Lady.

08:18.270 --> 08:19.070
My Lady.

08:19.430 --> 08:21.480
Aside from Miss Song Yiting,
who's feeling unwell,

08:21.480 --> 08:24.080
all the other madams
and young ladies are here.

08:24.600 --> 08:25.390
That's fine.

08:26.240 --> 08:27.560
Greetings, My Lady.

08:28.400 --> 08:31.480
Yimeng just brought some bubble tea.

08:29.820 --> 08:31.730
[Black Tea Pudding,
Jasmine Milk Tea, Misty Milk Tea]

08:31.830 --> 08:33.789
Ladies, please take a seat

08:33.840 --> 08:35.240
and enjoy it together.

08:35.990 --> 08:37.270
Thank you, My Lady.

08:47.840 --> 08:48.960
It's sweet and tasty.

08:48.960 --> 08:49.670
Look at mine.

08:49.670 --> 08:50.840
What does yours say?

08:51.750 --> 08:52.960
Oolong milk tea.

08:53.030 --> 08:54.560
What are matcha pearls?

08:54.630 --> 08:55.750
It tastes good.

08:59.840 --> 09:01.030
I haven't had it before.

09:01.030 --> 09:01.480
Same here.

09:01.480 --> 09:02.480
It's really good.

09:09.790 --> 09:11.520
I've invited you all here today

09:11.630 --> 09:13.000
because there's something urgent

09:13.000 --> 09:14.600
I'd like to discuss with you.

09:14.960 --> 09:15.750
My Lady,

09:16.030 --> 09:17.630
you flatter us.

09:18.000 --> 09:19.480
If you need anything,

09:19.480 --> 09:20.840
just say the word.

09:20.840 --> 09:21.670
Exactly.

09:25.030 --> 09:27.390
Heng is my only son.

09:27.630 --> 09:30.200
He spent years stationed at the border.

09:30.550 --> 09:31.390
Now it's time

09:31.390 --> 09:34.390
for him to get married
and carry on the royal line.

09:34.600 --> 09:35.670
Aside from Yimeng,

09:36.080 --> 09:37.440
your daughters

09:37.600 --> 09:40.480
are the most graceful and virtuous

09:40.480 --> 09:41.750
in the capital.

09:41.750 --> 09:43.030
All fine matches.

09:47.440 --> 09:48.200
What does this mean?

09:48.200 --> 09:48.910
My Lady,

09:49.240 --> 09:50.670
hasn't His Highness already been engaged

09:50.670 --> 09:53.000
to the eldest daughter of the Song family?

09:53.080 --> 09:54.480
According to tradition,

09:54.480 --> 09:56.480
a prince may have one principal consort

09:56.480 --> 09:58.670
and up to two concubines.

10:00.670 --> 10:01.630
Miss Jia,

10:01.840 --> 10:02.970
are you engaged yet?

10:09.000 --> 10:10.770
Guess she's not lucky enough
to marry the prince.

10:10.770 --> 10:13.700
Her fiancé is just about
to send the betrothal gifts.

10:14.670 --> 10:16.050
But I heard that

10:16.230 --> 10:17.960
you're still shopping around.

10:18.010 --> 10:19.390
You've basically

10:19.390 --> 10:21.360
visited every matchmaker in the capital.

10:21.360 --> 10:22.150
Are you lying

10:22.360 --> 10:24.200
to Her Ladyship
because you think His Highness

10:24.200 --> 10:25.670
isn't good enough for your daughter?

10:25.670 --> 10:26.630
Mrs. Song,

10:26.670 --> 10:29.070
Miss Yiting is famous
all over the capital.

10:29.300 --> 10:30.840
Why don't you say yes?

10:31.000 --> 10:32.240
My eldest daughter

10:32.240 --> 10:34.240
is the prince's principal consort.

10:34.870 --> 10:37.440
If my second daughter
became his concubine,

10:37.440 --> 10:39.100
wouldn't that be ridiculous?

10:39.240 --> 10:40.870
Even if I agreed,

10:40.870 --> 10:42.960
surely Her Ladyship wouldn't.

10:44.790 --> 10:46.150
I agree.

10:46.630 --> 10:48.550
What's wrong with two sisters

10:48.550 --> 10:49.840
sharing a husband?

10:52.240 --> 10:53.390
Oh right, Mrs. Liu,

10:53.600 --> 10:54.790
I heard that

10:54.810 --> 10:57.390
your daughter's birth chart
is incredibly auspicious,

10:57.390 --> 10:59.000
and she's a perfect match for the prince.

10:59.000 --> 11:00.750
Why don't you seize

11:00.750 --> 11:03.010
this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity?

11:05.390 --> 11:06.480
My daughter's…

11:07.600 --> 11:09.130
birth chart is indeed good,

11:09.240 --> 11:10.870
b-but…

11:12.440 --> 11:14.370
her grandfather just passed away.

11:14.480 --> 11:16.360
She's still in mourning.

11:16.360 --> 11:17.480
But if I recall correctly,

11:17.480 --> 11:19.880
your father passed away
over ten years ago.

11:23.200 --> 11:24.670
Why do I feel that

11:25.480 --> 11:26.840
none of you want

11:27.440 --> 11:29.200
your daughters to marry Heng?

11:29.480 --> 11:31.150
Is there something wrong with him?

11:31.150 --> 11:32.030
No.

11:32.670 --> 11:34.150
My Lady, you've misunderstood.

11:34.150 --> 11:36.350
His Highness is brilliant and valiant.

11:36.360 --> 11:37.630
It's not that my daughter

11:37.630 --> 11:39.870
refuses to be his concubine.

11:40.000 --> 11:40.790
It's just…

11:43.550 --> 11:44.360
just that…

11:45.550 --> 11:47.240
there's still Song Yimeng.

11:47.240 --> 11:47.840
Yeah.

11:47.840 --> 11:49.270
I-It's because of Song Yimeng.

11:49.270 --> 11:50.080
Me?

11:50.840 --> 11:51.630
Exactly.

11:52.080 --> 11:54.200
Everyone in the capital knows that

11:54.540 --> 11:56.480
Miss Song is rude, spoiled,

11:56.480 --> 11:57.680
grumpy, and jealous.

11:58.030 --> 12:01.030
If any other girl had to
share His Highness with you,

12:02.480 --> 12:04.230
she'd be tormented to death.

12:05.130 --> 12:05.800
[Misty Milk Tea]

12:08.000 --> 12:08.790
Yes!

12:08.990 --> 12:09.780
Song Yimeng

12:10.240 --> 12:11.240
is downright vicious.

12:11.240 --> 12:12.480
She has done more wrongs

12:12.480 --> 12:13.600
than you can count.

12:15.670 --> 12:17.150
S-Song Yimeng

12:18.440 --> 12:19.390
bullied people

12:19.670 --> 12:21.400
and terrorized her neighbors.

12:23.960 --> 12:25.000
Song Yimeng

12:26.000 --> 12:26.960
kicked down widows' doors,

12:26.960 --> 12:28.180
dug up graves,

12:28.630 --> 12:30.690
and beat up the disabled.

12:30.870 --> 12:31.670
Yes, yes, yes!

12:31.670 --> 12:32.110
Exactly!

12:32.110 --> 12:32.750
Yeah.

12:32.750 --> 12:33.480
Yeah.

12:33.480 --> 12:34.080
Yeah.

12:34.080 --> 12:34.870
Yeah, yeah.

12:38.460 --> 12:40.450
I see what's going on now.

12:40.790 --> 12:41.550
So basically,

12:41.550 --> 12:44.430
you're trashing me

12:44.600 --> 12:46.860
just to get out of marrying Nan Heng, huh?

12:47.750 --> 12:48.790
What trashing?

13:06.240 --> 13:07.030
Heng?

13:07.200 --> 13:08.530
What are you doing here?

13:09.870 --> 13:10.790
The ladies

13:10.810 --> 13:13.540
were just talking about
your marriage to Yimeng.

13:18.030 --> 13:20.030
I just caught a few fugitives

13:20.080 --> 13:22.030
and gutted them

13:22.030 --> 13:22.960
in the celestial prison.

13:22.960 --> 13:24.550
I was passing by the Fanghua Hall,

13:24.550 --> 13:26.150
so I dropped in to see you.

13:36.150 --> 13:37.240
I heard that

13:37.840 --> 13:40.240
you don't want to marry
your daughters to me

13:41.270 --> 13:43.670
because of my principal consort.

13:45.750 --> 13:46.600
Well then,

13:48.030 --> 13:49.550
since I'm here today,

13:50.790 --> 13:52.440
if any of you are truly interested,

13:52.440 --> 13:54.640
come up and let me
take a good look at you.

13:55.060 --> 13:56.350
If it feels right,

13:57.480 --> 13:58.240
I'll

13:59.240 --> 14:00.670
divorce Song Yimeng.

14:10.150 --> 14:11.360
Why are you so quiet?

14:18.270 --> 14:19.670
What are you trying to do?

14:21.480 --> 14:22.630
I'm bored.

14:23.390 --> 14:24.720
Just having a bit of fun.

14:30.240 --> 14:31.390
What's your name?

14:36.320 --> 14:36.840
I...

14:36.840 --> 14:37.600
I'm…

14:38.240 --> 14:39.030
the daughter

14:39.630 --> 14:40.440
of Qiao Yue,

14:40.750 --> 14:42.480
Vice Director of the Palace Library.

14:42.480 --> 14:43.240
My name is…

14:43.390 --> 14:44.870
Q-Q-Qiao…

14:44.870 --> 14:46.200
So you're a stutterer.

14:47.240 --> 14:48.240
So useless.

14:49.390 --> 14:52.320
Maybe I should throw her in prison
and have her executed.

14:52.320 --> 14:53.120
Mother.

14:53.120 --> 14:53.790
Mother.

14:54.150 --> 14:54.960
My Lady.

14:54.960 --> 14:55.600
This...

14:58.000 --> 14:58.660
You.

15:01.960 --> 15:03.710
Just now, I heard Mrs. Song say

15:04.270 --> 15:06.960
your birth chart matches mine best.

15:08.870 --> 15:10.150
What year were you born?

15:10.150 --> 15:10.910
The…

15:11.670 --> 15:12.730
the year of Renyin.

15:14.870 --> 15:17.150
Renyin? Then you're a tiger.

15:17.960 --> 15:19.870
But if you're a tiger,

15:20.080 --> 15:22.590
that clashes with my sign.

15:22.790 --> 15:24.030
If you marry me,

15:24.630 --> 15:26.360
will I bring misfortune on you,

15:26.600 --> 15:28.320
or will you bring misfortune on me?

15:28.320 --> 15:29.250
I wouldn't dare.

15:29.610 --> 15:30.670
You wouldn't dare?

15:31.550 --> 15:34.240
Then you must've lied to Her Ladyship.

15:34.690 --> 15:36.430
In the Xuanjia Army,

15:37.000 --> 15:38.950
lying like that gets you gutted

15:39.080 --> 15:40.880
and your heart boiled and eaten.

15:42.480 --> 15:43.770
Please forgive us, My Lady.

15:43.770 --> 15:45.370
Please spare us.

15:45.840 --> 15:47.660
Some street fortune-teller

15:48.080 --> 15:49.480
told me that!

15:49.480 --> 15:52.270
I would never dare lie to you!

15:59.870 --> 16:02.530
Weren't the two of you
the loudest ones earlier?

16:04.840 --> 16:06.240
Why so quiet now?

16:10.390 --> 16:11.250
Say something!

16:12.960 --> 16:13.820
Your Highness.

16:14.080 --> 16:15.150
Please forgive us!

16:15.360 --> 16:16.440
Please spare us!

16:17.360 --> 16:19.440
Spreading lies and causing trouble—

16:20.240 --> 16:22.120
the two of you should be thrown in prison

16:22.120 --> 16:23.780
and have your tongues cut out!

16:24.670 --> 16:25.270
My Lady.

16:25.270 --> 16:26.390
My Lady, save us!

16:26.390 --> 16:26.600
My Lady!

16:26.600 --> 16:27.600
My Lady, save us!

16:28.870 --> 16:30.600
I'll say it one more time today—

16:31.690 --> 16:32.820
Song Yimeng

16:33.480 --> 16:36.000
is marrying me because I begged her to.

16:37.030 --> 16:38.030
Her honor

16:39.200 --> 16:40.480
is my honor.

16:41.460 --> 16:42.990
Anyone who disrespected me

16:43.290 --> 16:45.190
has already died by my sword.

16:46.480 --> 16:48.340
Anyone who dares disrespect her—

16:49.480 --> 16:51.270
go ahead, try it.

16:52.440 --> 16:53.270
Please spare us.

16:53.270 --> 16:53.720
Please spare us.

16:53.720 --> 16:54.320
Please spare us.

16:54.320 --> 16:54.870
Please spare us.

16:54.870 --> 16:55.870
Please spare us.

16:55.870 --> 16:56.480
Please spare us.

16:56.480 --> 16:58.240
Please spare us.

16:58.240 --> 16:59.200
Please spare us.

16:59.720 --> 17:01.550
My Lady, please save us.

17:01.550 --> 17:02.880
My Lady, please save us.

17:06.270 --> 17:06.880
My Lady.

17:06.880 --> 17:07.200
My Lady.

17:07.200 --> 17:08.160
What's wrong with you?

17:08.160 --> 17:08.680
My Lady.

17:08.680 --> 17:09.310
My Lady.

17:09.310 --> 17:09.750
My Lady.

17:09.750 --> 17:10.310
Mother!

17:10.829 --> 17:11.349
My Lady.

17:11.349 --> 17:12.609
Mother, what's wrong?

17:12.920 --> 17:13.680
Send for the imperial physician.

17:13.680 --> 17:14.349
Go!

17:14.349 --> 17:15.000
Yes.

17:20.200 --> 17:21.440
There's milk in it?

17:22.069 --> 17:22.960
Mother has a weak stomach.

17:22.960 --> 17:24.089
She can't take milk.

17:24.339 --> 17:26.550
I made it for Her Ladyship.

17:27.030 --> 17:29.190
I didn't know she couldn't have milk.

17:33.110 --> 17:33.920
My Lady.

17:34.720 --> 17:35.510
My Lady.

18:04.880 --> 18:06.200
You should let the servants

18:06.200 --> 18:07.480
prepare the medicine.

18:07.960 --> 18:09.480
Sitting in the draft
in the middle of the night—

18:09.480 --> 18:10.480
if you fall ill,

18:11.160 --> 18:12.890
are you going to blame me for it?

18:20.480 --> 18:22.240
Her Ladyship fell ill because she drank

18:22.240 --> 18:23.300
the milk tea I made.

18:24.770 --> 18:26.090
I have to do something

18:26.240 --> 18:27.480
to make up for it.

18:36.880 --> 18:37.680
Did I

18:38.680 --> 18:39.750
scare you today?

18:42.440 --> 18:44.680
You're always either yelling at me

18:44.680 --> 18:46.140
or threatening to kill me.

18:46.240 --> 18:47.440
I'm used to it.

18:49.830 --> 18:52.000
Can you not be so sarcastic?

18:58.160 --> 19:00.080
In this palace, people are tricky.

19:00.080 --> 19:01.680
You can never be too careful.

19:01.740 --> 19:03.080
You may not hurt others,

19:03.240 --> 19:04.970
but others may want to hurt you.

19:05.830 --> 19:07.480
Soon after you got into the palace,

19:07.480 --> 19:09.030
you prepared food for Mother.

19:09.030 --> 19:10.290
That was a big mistake.

19:10.640 --> 19:12.790
What if someone had tried to poison her?

19:12.790 --> 19:14.650
What if they had framed you for it?

19:19.550 --> 19:21.960
This is a romance drama.

19:22.110 --> 19:23.830
It can't be so serious.

19:25.070 --> 19:26.470
What did you just mutter?

19:27.680 --> 19:28.480
Nothing.

19:29.240 --> 19:31.570
I heard you loud and clear, Your Highness.

19:33.200 --> 19:33.790
Here.

19:35.680 --> 19:36.480
Your Highness.

19:36.480 --> 19:37.480
This medicine

19:37.550 --> 19:40.350
was prepared exactly
as the imperial physician instructed.

19:40.350 --> 19:41.440
Now that you've touched it,

19:41.440 --> 19:42.830
if something goes wrong,

19:42.830 --> 19:44.160
it's on you.

20:02.160 --> 20:03.030
Thank you.

20:07.960 --> 20:09.190
I said…

20:09.750 --> 20:10.590
thank you.

20:14.240 --> 20:15.370
Are you thanking me?

20:23.400 --> 20:25.090
Are you out of your mind?

20:27.590 --> 20:29.310
You're the one who's out of your mind.

20:29.310 --> 20:30.110
Fine.

20:30.480 --> 20:31.750
I'm just out of my mind.

20:32.100 --> 20:34.070
That's why I thanked you.

20:34.270 --> 20:35.800
Just take it as an insult.

20:36.270 --> 20:37.110
Anyway,

20:37.110 --> 20:38.970
you're not used to being thanked.

20:42.350 --> 20:44.480
I've been insulted by plenty of people.

20:44.480 --> 20:46.480
One more doesn't make a difference.

20:57.030 --> 20:59.680
You said all those terrifying things

21:00.350 --> 21:02.240
in front of those ladies today.

21:02.750 --> 21:04.610
What if they took them seriously?

21:08.400 --> 21:09.440
To them,

21:10.350 --> 21:13.000
I'm just the murderous God of Death.

21:13.200 --> 21:15.310
Then explain it to those

21:15.310 --> 21:16.790
who misunderstand you.

21:17.030 --> 21:18.160
Tell them the truth.

21:22.750 --> 21:23.800
If I

21:24.030 --> 21:24.880
explained it to you,

21:24.880 --> 21:26.080
would you believe me?

21:30.680 --> 21:32.120
They call me God of Death.

21:32.270 --> 21:33.930
Isn't that what you think too?

21:34.680 --> 21:36.480
The world insults and curses me.

21:36.750 --> 21:38.410
And haven't you done the same?

21:41.640 --> 21:43.630
If even you won't believe me,

21:44.550 --> 21:47.480
why would I bother
explaining myself to anyone else?

21:55.850 --> 21:57.060
Was I…

21:58.030 --> 21:59.720
a little too harsh on you?

22:04.680 --> 22:06.160
Yeah, you were.

22:09.270 --> 22:10.070
But...

22:12.030 --> 22:12.880
it's fine.

22:35.510 --> 22:37.680
Miss Song drew this painting herself.

22:37.680 --> 22:39.750
Please make sure it gets to Mr. Li.

22:44.030 --> 22:45.240
Well, well, Yunlong,

22:45.590 --> 22:47.240
I didn't think I'd live to see

22:47.270 --> 22:48.920
the day you caught feelings.

22:56.070 --> 22:57.240
Why is it you?

22:59.030 --> 23:00.070
Do I know you?

23:00.680 --> 23:01.440
Lewd.

23:03.730 --> 23:04.640
You don't know me,

23:04.640 --> 23:05.830
and you're calling me lewd?

23:05.830 --> 23:07.160
You showed up uninvited

23:07.160 --> 23:08.890
and insulted me when you saw me.

23:09.960 --> 23:11.790
I'm just telling the truth.

23:12.960 --> 23:14.760
You were out there on the street,

23:14.880 --> 23:16.370
arms around two girls.

23:16.480 --> 23:17.160
I wonder

23:17.160 --> 23:20.000
why such an upright guy like Mr. Li

23:20.510 --> 23:22.240
keeps someone like you around.

23:24.350 --> 23:25.160
Fine.

23:25.830 --> 23:27.110
Guess I'm just unlucky
to have run into you,

23:27.110 --> 23:27.880
okay?

23:29.680 --> 23:30.480
Yunlong,

23:30.960 --> 23:31.750
let's go.

23:33.000 --> 23:34.240
You forgot the drawing.

23:34.240 --> 23:34.970
The drawing.

23:41.090 --> 23:41.680
You…

23:43.240 --> 23:44.640
you drew me this time?

23:45.680 --> 23:47.310
A fine sword for a noble man;

23:47.720 --> 23:49.720
a bamboo branch for a graceful lady.

23:49.830 --> 23:50.880
May I ask,

23:51.510 --> 23:52.680
what's your name?

23:53.240 --> 23:54.480
The 73rd painting.

23:54.590 --> 23:55.440
It's only…

23:55.590 --> 23:58.040
It's only the third day of the month.

24:02.590 --> 24:04.190
Miss Song Yiting, your hands

24:04.270 --> 24:05.310
are surprisingly strong.

24:05.310 --> 24:06.240
I like drawing.

24:06.240 --> 24:07.480
I want to draw. I'm good at it.

24:07.480 --> 24:08.660
What's it to you?

24:09.310 --> 24:10.970
Stop beating around the bush.

24:11.510 --> 24:12.400
Where is

24:12.640 --> 24:13.790
Mr. Li?

24:14.270 --> 24:15.550
I must see him today.

24:15.550 --> 24:16.270
Chief

24:16.790 --> 24:17.590
isn't here.

24:19.550 --> 24:20.480
He's not here right now,

24:20.480 --> 24:22.080
but he might come back later.

24:23.550 --> 24:24.600
Yunlong,

24:24.680 --> 24:27.480
go take Miss Song Yiting
upstairs to rest for a bit.

24:28.790 --> 24:30.290
Chief will be here soon.

24:39.750 --> 24:40.550
Stop!

24:44.550 --> 24:45.410
Second Master.

24:46.070 --> 24:47.470
This is not appropriate.

24:47.920 --> 24:49.400
What are you planning to do to Chief's

24:49.400 --> 24:51.400
sister-in-law while he's not here?

24:52.550 --> 24:53.400
You jerk.

24:53.550 --> 24:54.880
Am I that kind of person?

24:55.750 --> 24:56.440
Really?

24:56.440 --> 24:56.960
Yes.

24:56.960 --> 24:57.640
No!

24:58.080 --> 24:58.590
Look.

24:58.590 --> 24:59.590
Three days,

24:59.590 --> 25:00.830
73 paintings.

25:00.830 --> 25:02.360
She's obsessed with Chief.

25:02.440 --> 25:03.350
If we let her

25:03.350 --> 25:04.960
keep showing up like this,

25:04.960 --> 25:07.680
she'll end up causing trouble
for Chief sooner or later.

25:07.680 --> 25:09.000
If Chief's in trouble,

25:09.110 --> 25:10.880
I'll be in trouble too.

25:11.680 --> 25:12.960
So in the end,

25:13.110 --> 25:14.350
I made this mess,

25:14.590 --> 25:15.920
and I have to clean it up.

25:16.590 --> 25:18.070
So what's your plan?

25:19.270 --> 25:20.200
I'm a pro

25:20.480 --> 25:21.830
at breakups.

25:33.270 --> 25:33.920
Miss.

25:33.920 --> 25:34.640
Have a seat.

25:39.720 --> 25:40.510
Shannai.

25:40.880 --> 25:41.790
No need.

25:42.110 --> 25:43.480
The things outside

25:43.720 --> 25:44.510
are dirty.

25:46.270 --> 25:47.750
Waning River Crescent is too shabby.

25:47.750 --> 25:48.950
I hope you don't mind.

25:51.640 --> 25:53.110
Don't get me wrong, Mr. Li.

25:53.680 --> 25:54.880
I'm just really into cleanliness

25:54.880 --> 25:56.140
and never eat outside.

25:56.790 --> 25:58.450
It's not that I'm being picky.

25:58.720 --> 25:59.510
No worries,

26:00.000 --> 26:00.880
I get it.

26:12.640 --> 26:15.510
You're someone who appreciates kindness.

26:16.030 --> 26:19.070
I helped you once,

26:19.880 --> 26:21.410
and you sent me 73 paintings

26:21.440 --> 26:23.030
in three days.

26:25.240 --> 26:27.240
I really do appreciate the thought.

26:28.590 --> 26:31.000
As long as you like them.

26:31.640 --> 26:33.200
But sometimes, when you go overboard,

26:33.200 --> 26:34.860
it ends up becoming pressure.

26:35.720 --> 26:37.440
You're elegant

26:38.030 --> 26:39.430
and admired by everyone.

26:39.920 --> 26:41.200
If you were in danger,

26:41.640 --> 26:44.240
anyone would step in to help.

26:44.720 --> 26:45.750
What I did

26:45.880 --> 26:47.340
was not worth mentioning.

26:48.240 --> 26:49.030
But

26:50.030 --> 26:51.720
if you really want to thank me,

26:53.270 --> 26:55.480
why don't we just have some tea together

26:55.920 --> 26:57.070
and become friends?

26:57.550 --> 26:58.270
After that,

26:58.790 --> 27:00.590
you don't have to thank me again.

27:03.550 --> 27:04.920
Sorry. I'm so sorry.

27:05.510 --> 27:07.240
I went overboard

27:07.270 --> 27:09.200
and made you feel uncomfortable.

27:10.590 --> 27:12.350
I get what you're saying.

27:13.110 --> 27:13.970
I won't send you

27:14.510 --> 27:17.510
any more paintings.

27:27.440 --> 27:28.310
Mr. Li,

27:28.830 --> 27:29.830
I didn't send you

27:29.960 --> 27:31.640
those paintings just to say thank you.

27:31.640 --> 27:32.640
Like you said,

27:32.880 --> 27:34.940
I sent you 73 paintings in three days.

27:35.400 --> 27:36.830
Who does that

27:36.830 --> 27:38.400
just to say thank you?

27:39.680 --> 27:40.880
I like you.

27:57.400 --> 28:00.110
But you're pretty, talented,

28:00.750 --> 28:02.070
and from a powerful family.

28:02.070 --> 28:03.730
You're like a cloud in the sky.

28:03.920 --> 28:05.720
I have nothing to my name

28:05.720 --> 28:07.110
and am always risking my life.

28:07.110 --> 28:08.480
I'm like the mud on the ground.

28:08.480 --> 28:09.880
We are so different.

28:09.880 --> 28:12.160
You're way out of my league.

28:12.640 --> 28:13.500
How about this?

28:14.790 --> 28:16.640
Let's finish this cup of tea

28:17.030 --> 28:19.750
and go our separate ways.

28:25.240 --> 28:26.550
I see.

28:27.240 --> 28:28.070
Mr. Li,

28:28.880 --> 28:30.110
you're refusing me.

28:33.270 --> 28:36.310
Falling petals want to follow the stream,

28:36.880 --> 28:39.880
but the stream has no interest in them.

28:41.480 --> 28:42.790
Love

28:43.110 --> 28:45.070
can't be forced.

28:47.110 --> 28:47.960
I'll drink…

28:50.110 --> 28:51.350
this cup of tea.

29:01.270 --> 29:02.800
Sure, I'm a cloud in the sky,

29:03.240 --> 29:04.750
but since I like you,

29:05.030 --> 29:06.830
you're hardly mud on the ground.

29:07.310 --> 29:08.880
I'm just surprised that

29:09.350 --> 29:12.110
someone as free-spirited as you

29:12.830 --> 29:14.680
would care about family status.

29:18.000 --> 29:19.730
You've lived a sheltered life.

29:20.000 --> 29:22.000
How could you know how tough life is?

29:24.350 --> 29:25.880
People in the martial world

29:26.240 --> 29:28.400
don't get a monthly salary,

29:29.000 --> 29:30.400
own land, or have houses.

29:30.480 --> 29:31.740
Home is wherever we go.

29:33.270 --> 29:35.270
You won't even drink from a cup here,

29:35.750 --> 29:37.270
but I'm usually out there

29:37.510 --> 29:40.350
surviving on whatever I can find.

30:02.400 --> 30:04.200
I can drink this tea,

30:05.310 --> 30:06.840
but it looks like you can't.

30:10.030 --> 30:11.830
It seems you didn't get my point.

30:11.830 --> 30:12.030
I...

30:12.030 --> 30:12.750
I get it.

30:12.750 --> 30:14.000
You don't get a salary,

30:14.000 --> 30:15.550
but I can support you
with my monthly allowance

30:15.550 --> 30:16.640
from my family.

30:16.960 --> 30:18.830
Land and houses are no problem.

30:19.000 --> 30:21.260
Across all 36 prefectures of Great Jing,

30:21.270 --> 30:23.480
the Song family has estates everywhere.

30:23.480 --> 30:25.110
If you want to roam the world,

30:25.480 --> 30:26.680
as long as you marry me,

30:26.680 --> 30:28.680
my home will be your home.

30:28.790 --> 30:29.590
No, wait,

30:29.880 --> 30:31.210
how could I accept that?

30:31.270 --> 30:32.960
I'd be living off a woman.

30:33.270 --> 30:34.790
When two people love each other,

30:34.790 --> 30:37.070
nothing else matters.

30:38.640 --> 30:40.070
If you keep me happy,

30:40.270 --> 30:42.350
who cares who pays the bills?

30:43.510 --> 30:45.170
B-But what if I don't like you?

30:45.510 --> 30:46.840
What if I'm not into you?

30:47.480 --> 30:49.270
Then I'll make you fall for me.

30:50.200 --> 30:51.660
You just said it yourself,

30:51.680 --> 30:52.880
someone like me

30:53.270 --> 30:54.440
is admired by countless people.

30:54.440 --> 30:54.680
But

30:54.680 --> 30:56.550
I'm not one of them.

30:56.550 --> 30:57.350
Look at me.

30:57.680 --> 30:59.030
I love freedom.

30:59.160 --> 31:00.960
I don't want to be tied to anyone.

31:05.270 --> 31:06.240
Mr. Li,

31:06.640 --> 31:08.270
running a place this big

31:09.030 --> 31:10.720
must give you little freedom.

31:14.030 --> 31:15.560
You hit the nail on the head.

31:17.070 --> 31:17.880
That's right.

31:18.240 --> 31:20.770
I need to keep
Waning River Crescent running.

31:21.000 --> 31:23.030
Building a career

31:23.030 --> 31:24.510
is my top priority right now.

31:24.510 --> 31:25.350
Romance

31:25.350 --> 31:26.830
just gets in the way of business

31:26.830 --> 31:27.830
and making money.

31:29.750 --> 31:31.200
A month has 30 days.

31:31.440 --> 31:32.640
I spend five playing the qin,

31:32.640 --> 31:33.680
five reading,

31:33.680 --> 31:34.720
five painting,

31:35.070 --> 31:36.640
five out with my friends,

31:36.750 --> 31:38.510
and five with my parents.

31:39.270 --> 31:40.750
The days I need you

31:41.200 --> 31:42.270
add up to just five.

31:42.790 --> 31:43.680
On those five days,

31:43.680 --> 31:46.480
I'll pay you double your daily take.

31:46.480 --> 31:47.830
You won't lose a cent.

31:50.830 --> 31:52.840
[Three years ago]

31:51.480 --> 31:52.830
I can run it for you.

31:53.030 --> 31:54.580
But let me make it clear.

31:54.750 --> 31:56.150
A month has 30 days.

31:56.240 --> 31:57.590
I spend five traveling,

31:57.720 --> 31:58.880
five playing the flute,

31:58.880 --> 32:00.160
five feasting,

32:00.160 --> 32:01.440
five visiting old friends,

32:01.440 --> 32:02.400
and five…

32:04.400 --> 32:05.550
I'm not telling you.

32:05.750 --> 32:06.550
In short,

32:06.880 --> 32:09.000
I can only stay here five days a month

32:09.000 --> 32:10.590
to run this place for you.

32:10.680 --> 32:11.480
How's that?

32:15.440 --> 32:15.960
Wait,

32:15.960 --> 32:17.690
is that how you treat feelings?

32:17.880 --> 32:19.440
Can money fix everything?

32:20.200 --> 32:21.270
Can your money buy company

32:21.270 --> 32:22.350
or true affection?

32:23.200 --> 32:25.070
Money is just a worldly thing.

32:25.350 --> 32:27.880
If money can solve matters of the heart,

32:28.160 --> 32:29.240
why not use it?

32:29.640 --> 32:31.590
What I want is you

32:31.880 --> 32:32.740
and your heart.

32:33.350 --> 32:35.720
Love not weighed down by money

32:36.030 --> 32:37.590
is the purest love of all.

32:42.550 --> 32:44.070
L-Let me think.

32:44.270 --> 32:45.270
Let me think.

32:47.880 --> 32:48.640
Mr. Li.

32:48.920 --> 32:50.000
Think it over.

32:51.480 --> 32:52.680
I'll wait right here…

32:54.510 --> 32:55.680
for your answer.

33:02.540 --> 33:03.650
[Chuyun Palace]

33:31.990 --> 33:32.780
My Lady,

33:33.200 --> 33:34.240
you sent for me?

33:34.240 --> 33:34.960
Yimeng,

33:34.960 --> 33:35.790
come here.

33:36.510 --> 33:37.310
My Lady,

33:37.590 --> 33:39.120
are you feeling any better?

33:40.000 --> 33:42.640
I made some snacks just for Heng,

33:42.640 --> 33:43.640
but he left in a hurry

33:43.640 --> 33:44.970
and forgot to take them.

33:45.550 --> 33:46.830
Go catch up to him.

33:47.000 --> 33:49.110
Give them to him for me.

33:50.640 --> 33:51.790
Isn't this

33:51.880 --> 33:54.160
something Eunuch Yang should do?

33:54.790 --> 33:56.030
But look around.

33:56.440 --> 33:57.790
In this entire hall,

33:57.960 --> 33:59.440
is there anyone else?

34:03.880 --> 34:04.640
My Lady,

34:04.960 --> 34:08.150
isn't that a little too obvious?

34:08.920 --> 34:09.920
Good girl,

34:09.920 --> 34:12.070
since you know what I want,

34:12.070 --> 34:13.760
go chase after him now.

34:15.030 --> 34:15.840
But

34:15.960 --> 34:16.760
My Lady,

34:16.800 --> 34:18.280
His Highness and me…

34:18.480 --> 34:20.030
w-we...

34:22.840 --> 34:25.040
Since drinking the milk tea yesterday,

34:25.360 --> 34:28.670
I've been feeling so uncomfortable.

34:29.320 --> 34:30.280
Fine, I'll go.

34:30.320 --> 34:31.480
I'll go right now.

34:37.920 --> 34:40.840
I heard you made a scene
in the Fanghua Hall yesterday

34:40.840 --> 34:43.880
and scared those
noble ladies half to death.

34:44.960 --> 34:46.670
Song Yimeng is my principal consort.

34:46.670 --> 34:48.800
How could I let people speak ill of her?

34:48.840 --> 34:50.360
Judging from your tone,

34:51.190 --> 34:52.760
the marriage with the Song family

34:52.760 --> 34:54.400
is already set in stone.

34:56.960 --> 34:59.620
Uncle, why does this
matter concern you so much?

35:00.320 --> 35:01.320
Regarding the enfeoffment,

35:01.320 --> 35:03.630
it's clear that His Majesty
has revived the old rule

35:03.630 --> 35:05.440
from the previous dynasty
just to target you.

35:05.440 --> 35:08.480
Yet the Eighteenth Prince
runs to the Song Residence every day,

35:08.480 --> 35:09.920
showering Miss Song Yiting

35:09.920 --> 35:12.030
with attention and gifts,

35:12.510 --> 35:14.110
showing no restraint at all.

35:15.840 --> 35:17.970
I have my own plan for the enfeoffment.

35:18.590 --> 35:19.550
As for Nan Rui,

35:20.550 --> 35:22.320
although I don't know Song Yiting,

35:22.320 --> 35:24.880
I doubt she thinks much of Nan Rui.

35:25.550 --> 35:27.110
Miss Song Yiting may not care,

35:27.110 --> 35:29.840
but her mother, Madam Zhou, clearly does.

35:31.280 --> 35:32.880
My view remains the same:

35:33.670 --> 35:36.000
rather than letting
Miss Song Yiting marry someone else

35:36.000 --> 35:37.730
and strengthen another force,

35:37.840 --> 35:40.480
you should marry both Song sisters.

35:40.970 --> 35:42.800
A wife should be chosen for her virtue,

35:42.800 --> 35:44.260
a concubine for her looks.

35:45.070 --> 35:48.070
We need to get a firm grip
on the Song family's power.

35:50.360 --> 35:51.360
My answer

35:52.760 --> 35:53.920
hasn't changed.

35:55.550 --> 35:56.360
Absurd.

35:56.510 --> 35:57.360
Good.

36:14.110 --> 36:16.240
A wife should be chosen for her virtue,

36:16.670 --> 36:18.480
a concubine for her looks?

36:19.150 --> 36:20.110
Good?

36:25.770 --> 36:32.550
[A Dream of Qingning,
Episode 22, Scene 12]

36:27.030 --> 36:27.710
Nan Heng!

36:37.030 --> 36:38.590
Instead of staying at home,

36:38.800 --> 36:40.070
what are you doing here?

36:40.070 --> 36:42.280
If I hadn't followed her here,

36:43.280 --> 36:45.000
I wouldn't have known you two

36:45.000 --> 36:46.760
were so shameless!

36:48.360 --> 36:49.280
Song Yiting!

36:50.130 --> 36:52.060
He is your brother-in-law!

36:54.110 --> 36:55.590
He used to be.

36:56.030 --> 36:56.890
But from now on,

36:57.110 --> 36:58.480
he'll be my husband.

37:00.000 --> 37:02.130
I'll let you be his principal consort,

37:02.400 --> 37:04.070
but keep this in mind:

37:04.440 --> 37:05.670
the one he loves most

37:06.750 --> 37:07.810
is me.

37:11.480 --> 37:12.800
That's not true.

37:13.070 --> 37:14.070
That's not true!

37:23.590 --> 37:24.480
What I choose to do

37:24.480 --> 37:25.810
is none of your concern.

37:26.400 --> 37:27.190
Get out!

37:28.880 --> 37:29.670
Oh no.

37:30.360 --> 37:32.140
That toxic scene

37:32.230 --> 37:33.030
is coming.

37:33.780 --> 37:35.450
[Iconic Scenes in the Script]

37:35.530 --> 37:38.700
[4. The Sister-in-Law
and the Brother-in-Law's Affair]

37:38.760 --> 37:42.240
[Immoral]

37:46.880 --> 37:48.480
It's so late,

37:48.630 --> 37:50.830
and Mr. Li still hasn't given an answer.

37:51.550 --> 37:53.400
Guess that's a no.

37:57.480 --> 37:58.280
My Lady,

37:58.800 --> 38:00.920
just let it go and look ahead.

38:01.110 --> 38:02.230
The world is vast.

38:02.280 --> 38:04.280
There are millions of good men out there.

38:04.280 --> 38:06.400
You're sure to meet someone better.

38:09.550 --> 38:10.360
Oh no.

38:10.710 --> 38:12.630
You left your handkerchief on the table.

38:12.630 --> 38:14.840
Something that personal must be retrieved.

38:14.840 --> 38:15.630
Please wait here.

38:15.630 --> 38:17.030
I'll go back and fetch it.

39:46.700 --> 39:47.540
Qianyu?

39:49.660 --> 39:50.660
This is...

39:51.960 --> 39:53.620
Qianyu Moon-Cleaving Blade.

40:07.070 --> 40:08.280
As soon as Chief is gone,

40:08.280 --> 40:09.940
someone starts slacking off.

40:10.630 --> 40:11.630
Has Song Yiting left?

40:11.630 --> 40:12.360
Relax.

40:12.360 --> 40:14.360
I watched her leave with my own eyes.

40:15.360 --> 40:17.000
We're drowning in work,

40:17.000 --> 40:18.610
and you're sitting here drinking?

40:18.610 --> 40:20.000
I do brain work,

40:20.000 --> 40:21.070
not grunt work.

40:21.070 --> 40:22.030
What did you do?

40:22.280 --> 40:24.480
Helping Chief get rid of Song Yiting.

40:25.360 --> 40:26.330
Never mind.

40:26.630 --> 40:28.070
My amazing face

40:28.070 --> 40:29.150
and unmatched charm

40:29.150 --> 40:30.910
are heaven's gifts

40:31.110 --> 40:33.630
and my lifelong curse.

40:34.150 --> 40:35.030
Seriously?

40:35.230 --> 40:36.960
Miss Song Yiting likes Chief.

40:36.960 --> 40:38.000
He wears a mask.

40:38.000 --> 40:39.330
It's not about his face.

40:40.070 --> 40:41.630
And it sure isn't about you.

40:49.960 --> 40:51.280
Qianyu Moon-Cleaving Blade is missing.

40:51.280 --> 40:52.080
It was stolen.

40:52.400 --> 40:53.360
Who's got the nerve

40:53.360 --> 40:54.710
to steal from Waning River Crescent?

40:54.710 --> 40:55.590
Yunlong, after them!

40:55.590 --> 40:56.230
No need.

40:58.490 --> 41:01.210
[Come to the garden of the Song
Residence at noon tomorrow. Yiting]

40:58.840 --> 40:59.840
Come to the garden

41:00.280 --> 41:02.030
of the Song Residence at noon tomorrow.
